    descriptionKo: "비가 오는 도시 환경을 위한 GORE-TEX 방수 기능을 갖춘 독특한 다운 파카입니다.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009875/black/8.jpg"],
