    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Covert Pant", "bodyKo": "Go head-to-toe cozy in these abrasion-resistant fleece pants built for durable warmth on the trail or at the hut. For the first time ever, we took our long-standing Covert fleece favourite and turned it into hardworking insulation for your legs. Recycled fleece with a bit of stretch resists pilling and rock snags, so this long-lasting layer will get you through years of missions. More styles include the Covert Cardigan and Covert 1/2 Zip Neck .", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/mongoose-heather/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 레귤러", "bodyKo": "클래식 핏은 가슴, 허리, 엉덩이, 허벅지 전체에 걸쳐 편안하게 재단됩니다. 이는 자유로운 움직임을 허용하고, 레귤러하고 편안한 핏의 쉘 아래에 편안하게 모양과 레이어를 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/mongoose-heather/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술 특징", "bodyKo": "Durable · Versatile · Midweight warmth", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/mongoose-heather/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Recycled, abrasion-resistant polyester fleece with stretch for mobility", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/mongoose-heather/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Straight leg · Garment Inseam: Size S is 29\"/73cm — Inseam varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/mongoose-heather/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/mongoose-heather/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · One zippered leg pocket", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/mongoose-heather/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속가능성", "bodyKo": "Body - recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Contrast - FC0 DWR, recycled content", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/mongoose-heather/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "허리 및 벨트 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 신축성 있는 허리 조임끈", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/black-heather/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: Alpenex II - 100% Recycled Polyester Heather sweater look fleece, 340gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/black-heather/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "세탁기 약하게 세탁 / 건조기에 건조 보통 약하게 · 표백하지 마세요 · 어두운 색상은 단독세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 다림질 금지 · 섬유유연제 사용금지", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/black-heather/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Regular", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010737/black-heather/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 레귤러: 클래식 핏은 가슴, 허리, 엉덩이, 허벅지 전체에 걸쳐 편안하게 재단됩니다. 이는 자유로운 움직임을 허용하고, 레귤러하고 편안한 핏의 쉘 아래에 편안하게 모양과 레이어를 제공합니다.", "기술 특징: Durable · Versatile · Midweight warmth", "구조: Recycled, abrasion-resistant polyester fleece with stretch for mobility", "디자인 및 핏: Straight leg · Garment Inseam: Size S is 29\"/73cm — Inseam varies by size", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · One zippered leg pocket", "지속가능성: Body - recycled content · Lining - bluepass Material, recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Contrast - FC0 DWR, recycled content", "허리 및 벨트 구성: 조절 가능한 신축성 있는 허리 조임끈", "소재: Body: Alpenex II - 100% Recycled Polyester Heather sweater look fleece, 340gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리: 세탁기 약하게 세탁 / 건조기에 건조 보통 약하게 · 표백하지 마세요 · 어두운 색상은 단독세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 다림질 금지 · 섬유유연제 사용금지", "핏: Regular"],
