    tags: ["arcteryx", "아크테릭스", "clothing", "ax-womens", "womens"],
    descriptionKo: "추운 중간 출력의 산악 활동을 위한 가장 따뜻한 열 매핑 Atom입니다.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009852/nightscape/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009852/nightscape/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009852/nightscape/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009852/nightscape/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009852/nightscape/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009852/nightscape/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009852/nightscape/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009852/nightscape/7.jpg"],
