    descriptionKo: "다운 insulation와 GORE-TEX 방수 기능을 갖춘 따뜻하고 편안한 핏의 재킷.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009958/black/8.jpg"],
