    storySections: [{"titleKo": "은밀한 1/2 지퍼 넥", "bodyKo": "We designed this pullover for hiking—but there’s a good chance you’ll grab it for daily, durable warmth. Built from recycled fleece with a bit of stretch that resists pilling, rock snags, and pack rub, this pullover will stick around for years of trail missions and hut trips . Hardworking and flexible, Covert fleece is a long-standing insulation favourite in any layering system. What's been updated: This updated fabric has stretch for mobility and improved abrasion and pilling resistance for durability . The design has been adjusted to a regular fit (rather than fitted) for better mobility and ease of layering over base layers. Zippered side-entry hand pockets have been added for extra storage. Centre-front zipper has been extended from a quarter-zip in the previous version to a half- zip for better ventilation. More styles include the Covert Vest , Covert Pullover Hoody and, Covert Cardigan .", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/void-heather/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 레귤러", "bodyKo": "클래식 핏은 가슴, 허리, 엉덩이, 허벅지 전체에 걸쳐 편안하게 재단됩니다. 이는 움직임의 자유를 허용하고 모양을 제공하며 레이어 위 또는 아래에 편안하게 레이어를 제공합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/void-heather/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술 특징", "bodyKo": "Durable · Versatile · Midweight warmth", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/void-heather/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Recycled, abrasion-resistant polyester fleece with stretch for mobility", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/void-heather/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/void-heather/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "Two hand pockets with zippers · Sleeve pocket with zip", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/void-heather/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지속가능성", "bodyKo": "본체 - 재활용 함량 · 안감 - 블루패스 소재, 재활용 함량 · PFAS(Per- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/void-heather/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "Chest half zip", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/void-heather/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Body: Alpenex II - 100% Recycled Polyester Heather sweater look fleece, 340gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/black-heather/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "세탁기 약하게 세탁 / 건조기에 건조 보통 약하게 · 표백하지 마세요 · 어두운 색상은 단독세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 다림질 금지 · 섬유유연제 사용금지", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/black-heather/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "핏", "bodyKo": "Regular", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010729/black-heather/3.jpg"}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 레귤러: 클래식 핏은 가슴, 허리, 엉덩이, 허벅지 전체에 걸쳐 편안하게 재단됩니다. 이는 움직임의 자유를 허용하고 모양을 제공하며 레이어 위 또는 아래에 편안하게 레이어를 제공합니다.", "기술 특징: Durable · Versatile · Midweight warmth", "구조: Recycled, abrasion-resistant polyester fleece with stretch for mobility", "밑단 구성: 조절 가능한 밑단 드로우 코드로 통풍을 차단합니다.", "포켓 구성: Two hand pockets with zippers · Sleeve pocket with zip", "지속가능성: 본체 - 재활용 함량 · 안감 - 블루패스 소재, 재활용 함량 · PFAS(Per- 및 폴리플루오로알킬 물질) 준수", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Chest half zip", "소재: Body: Alpenex II - 100% Recycled Polyester Heather sweater look fleece, 340gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of dyeing: TAIWAN, CHINA · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리: 세탁기 약하게 세탁 / 건조기에 건조 보통 약하게 · 표백하지 마세요 · 어두운 색상은 단독세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 다림질 금지 · 섬유유연제 사용금지", "핏: Regular"],
