    descriptionKo: "GORE-TEX PRO ePE 스키 및 스노보드 바지는 산악 전문가를 위해 제작되었습니다.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009198/black/8.jpg"],
