    tags: ["arcteryx", "아크테릭스", "clothing", "ax-mens", "mens"],
    descriptionKo: "가볍고 통기성이 뛰어나며 발수 기능이 뛰어난 Spere 소프트쉘 팬츠로 수납 공간이 확장되었습니다.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000010622/black/8.jpg"],
