    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Naroda Insulated Jacket", "bodyKo": "The Naroda Insulated Jacket is an MA-2 bomber jacket-inspired design with insulation and a front-zippered closure. Soft Taslan face fabric features a crinkled texture. A unique elastic hem features stitched detailing, while the shirt collar creates a classic silhouette. Two side-zip pockets and one interior pocket provide storage.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 릴랙스", "bodyKo": "이 핏은 가슴, 허리, 엉덩이, 허벅지를 통해 루즈하게 재단됩니다. 구조감과 깔끔한 ​​라인을 희생하지 않고 여유로움을 더해 더욱 캐주얼한 룩으로 편안함과 자유로운 움직임을 선사합니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술 특징", "bodyKo": "Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "82gsm nylon face fabric with recycled content is lightweight and durable · Mapped insulation adds warmth in the body, collar, and in the hem and cuff", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Garment Centre Back Length: Size M is 25\"/64cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/black/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "원단 처리", "bodyKo": "FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/black/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "신축성 있는 밑단과 커프스가 날씨를 막아줍니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/black/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "로고 및 라벨 구성", "bodyKo": "Flag label on wearer’s left side", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/black/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "지퍼가 달린 측면 포켓 2개 · 내부 포켓", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/neptune/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속가능성", "bodyKo": "Insulation - recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Lining 1 - bluepass Material, FC0 DWR, recycled content · Shell - FC0 DWR, recycled content · Lining 2 - FC0 DWR", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/neptune/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "지퍼 및 플라이 구성", "bodyKo": "Full length Vislon front zip", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/neptune/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Continuous 90 (90 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Lining: Recycled 20d nylon plain weave weft stretch FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Body: Recycled Taslan Woven, 82gsm, Recycled Nylon FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010673/neptune/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 릴랙스: 이 핏은 가슴, 허리, 엉덩이, 허벅지를 통해 루즈하게 재단됩니다. 구조감과 깔끔한 ​​라인을 희생하지 않고 여유로움을 더해 더욱 캐주얼한 룩으로 편안함과 자유로운 움직임을 선사합니다.", "기술 특징: Moisture-resistant outer face fabric · Breathable · Lightweight", "구조: 82gsm nylon face fabric with recycled content is lightweight and durable · Mapped insulation adds warmth in the body, collar, and in the hem and cuff", "디자인 및 핏: Garment Centre Back Length: Size M is 25\"/64cm - Varies by size", "원단 처리: FC0 DWR(내구성 발수) 마감 처리로 습기를 차단하고 의도적으로 PFAS를 첨가하지 않았습니다.", "밑단 구성: 신축성 있는 밑단과 커프스가 날씨를 막아줍니다.", "로고 및 라벨 구성: Flag label on wearer’s left side", "포켓 구성: 지퍼가 달린 측면 포켓 2개 · 내부 포켓", "지속가능성: Insulation - recycled content · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Lining 1 - bluepass Material, FC0 DWR, recycled content · Shell - FC0 DWR, recycled content · Lining 2 - FC0 DWR", "지퍼 및 플라이 구성: Full length Vislon front zip", "소재: Synthetic Insulation: Coreloft™ Continuous 90 (90 g/m²) - 100% Polyester · Lining: Recycled 20d nylon plain weave weft stretch FC0 DWR, 58gsm - 88% Nylon, 12% Elastane · Body: Recycled Taslan Woven, 82gsm, Recycled Nylon FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리: Machine wash gentle medium · Tumble dry normal low · Do not bleach · Wash dark colours separately · Do not dry clean · Do not iron · Do not use fabric softener · Double rinse · Front load washer recommended · Use mesh bag for top load washer", "핏: Relaxed"],
