    inStock: true,
    storySections: [{"titleKo": "Delta Hybrid Hoody", "bodyKo": "Somewhere between a fleece and a shell, the Delta Hybrid Hoody hits the sweet spot for breathability and protection—perfect for the stop-and-go rhythm of multi-pitch climbing and all medium-output mountain activities. The wind-resistant double-weave Airshell panels reinforce the trusted performance of Octa® fleece, adding targeted protection. The fitted profile tucks under a harness cleanly, thumb loops secure sleeves, and the helmet-compatible StormHood™ maintains visibility on lead.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/stratus/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "핏: 슬림 핏", "bodyKo": "우리의 트리머 핏은 가슴, 허리, 엉덩이, 허벅지를 통해 몸에 가깝게 유지되도록 패턴화되었습니다. 로우 프로파일은 부피를 줄이고 신체와 함께 움직이며 첫 번째 레이어 위나 외부 레이어 아래에 편안하게 맞습니다.", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/stratus/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "기술 특징", "bodyKo": "Breathable · Great warmth-to-weight ratio · Wind resistant · Versatile", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/stratus/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "구조", "bodyKo": "Airshell panels—made with 15d recycled nylon double-weave fabric—add targeted protection across the shoulders, chest, and hood · Lightweight, breathable Octa® fleece features eight-fin hollow-core fibres that trap heat as effectively as heavier yarn · Hybrid construction balances insulation, breathability, and weather protection", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/stratus/4.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 및 소매 구성", "bodyKo": "Thumb loops for easy wear over or under other layers", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/stratus/5.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "디자인 및 핏", "bodyKo": "Fitted for efficient fabric performance, easy layering · Garment Centre Back Length: Size M is 29\"/72cm - Varies by size", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/stratus/6.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "밑단 구성", "bodyKo": "균일한 주름과 길이 조절이 가능한 듀얼 S 잠금 밑단 신치", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/stratus/7.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "후드 구성", "bodyKo": "Fully adjustable Airshell StormHood™ offers a precise fit with unobstructed upward and peripheral visibility", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/stratus/8.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "포켓 구성", "bodyKo": "지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개 · 가슴 포켓", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/black/1.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "지속가능성", "bodyKo": "Body - recycled content · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Silvadur™ ) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Lining - FC0 DWR", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/black/2.jpg", "reverse": true}, {"titleKo": "소재", "bodyKo": "Contrast: 15d nylon double weave ripstop mechanical stretch, 42gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Body: Octa Polyester Fleece, 40D Delta Face, 122gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/black/3.jpg"}, {"titleKo": "관리", "bodyKo": "세탁기 약하게 세탁 · 건조기로 약하게 건조 · 표백하지 마세요 · 어두운 색상은 단독세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 다림질 금지 · 섬유 유연제 사용 금지 · 즉시 제거 · 뒤집어서 세탁하지 마세요 · 짜지 마세요", "image": "/products/axa-pdp/X000010633/black/4.jpg", "reverse": true}],
    featuresKo: ["핏: 슬림 핏: 우리의 트리머 핏은 가슴, 허리, 엉덩이, 허벅지를 통해 몸에 가깝게 유지되도록 패턴화되었습니다. 로우 프로파일은 부피를 줄이고 신체와 함께 움직이며 첫 번째 레이어 위나 외부 레이어 아래에 편안하게 맞습니다.", "기술 특징: Breathable · Great warmth-to-weight ratio · Wind resistant · Versatile", "구조: Airshell panels—made with 15d recycled nylon double-weave fabric—add targeted protection across the shoulders, chest, and hood · Lightweight, breathable Octa® fleece features eight-fin hollow-core fibres that trap heat as effectively as heavier yarn · Hybrid construction balances insulation, breathability, and weather protection", "밑단 및 소매 구성: Thumb loops for easy wear over or under other layers", "디자인 및 핏: Fitted for efficient fabric performance, easy layering · Garment Centre Back Length: Size M is 29\"/72cm - Varies by size", "밑단 구성: 균일한 주름과 길이 조절이 가능한 듀얼 S 잠금 밑단 신치", "후드 구성: Fully adjustable Airshell StormHood™ offers a precise fit with unobstructed upward and peripheral visibility", "포켓 구성: 지퍼가 달린 핸드 포켓 2개 · 가슴 포켓", "지속가능성: Body - recycled content · This article was treated with an anti-odour biocidal product (Silvadur™ ) · PFAS (Per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances) Compliant · Lining - FC0 DWR", "소재: Contrast: 15d nylon double weave ripstop mechanical stretch, 42gsm, FC0 DWR - 100% Nylon · Body: Octa Polyester Fleece, 40D Delta Face, 122gsm - 100% Polyester · Origin of fabric: JAPAN · Origin of dyeing: JAPAN · Origin of Manufacture: VIETNAM · May release plastic microfibres into the environment when washing", "관리: 세탁기 약하게 세탁 · 건조기로 약하게 건조 · 표백하지 마세요 · 어두운 색상은 단독세탁 · 드라이클리닝 금지 · 다림질 금지 · 섬유 유연제 사용 금지 · 즉시 제거 · 뒤집어서 세탁하지 마세요 · 짜지 마세요", "핏: 슬림 핏"],
