    descriptionKo: "모든 산악 지역에서 사용할 수 있는 내구성, 통기성, 내후성 GORE-TEX PRO ePE 쉘.",
    image: "/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/1.jpg",
    images: ["/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/1.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/2.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/3.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/4.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/5.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/6.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/7.jpg", "/products/axa-pdp/X000009906/headwaters/8.jpg"],
